{"version":1,"title":"DESIGN-LAB 全量审计与后续成熟方案 Deep Research 执行提示词","backing_conversation_id":"6ab12e9e-6168-83e8-bfe6-be1a81dfcfda","widget_session_id":"51494165-3c4a-4183-a24a-041529139678","widget_state":{"status":"completed","is_static_preview":true,"report_message":{"id":"b1b6d922-946f-4c36-bc9a-ae02431bd5ff","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":1789996773.405539,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"text","parts":["# DESIGN-LAB 全量审计与后续成熟方案 Deep Research 执行提示词\n\n以下提示词可直接交给深度研究系统执行。它将此前三轮调研、当前 DESIGN-LAB 审计重点，以及已形成的 **MiniMax Design + 本地 ComfyUI + MiniMax H3** 集成研究纳入统一验证框架；此前研究只能作为待验证输入，不能替代当前仓库与官方资料的实时事实。已上传的 MiniMax/ComfyUI/H3 集成报告可作为前置研究材料使用。fileciteturn0file0\n\n```text\n你现在是 DESIGN-LAB 项目的首席架构师、资深全栈工程师、Adobe 自动化集成工程师、桌面软件自动化专家、CI/CD 工程师、Python Packaging 工程师、数据库架构师、QA/Evidence 审计工程师。\n\n请对 GitHub 仓库：\n\nDTALEX66/DESIGN-LAB\n\n执行一次“从实时云端事实重新开始”的全量深度研究与成熟度审计，并基于此次实时审计、此前三轮调研结论以及现有 MiniMax Design / ComfyUI / H3 / Adobe 研究，最终产出一份：\n\n《DESIGN-LAB 全量审计与后续成熟方案 Final Maturity Convergence TaskPack》\n\n这不是普通代码 Review。\n\n目标是回答四个核心问题：\n\n1. DESIGN-LAB 当前到底已经做到什么程度，哪些能力是真实可运行，哪些只是合同、代码、历史证据或文档宣称？\n2. 为什么 Photoshop / Illustrator / Adobe 软件控制目前推进较慢？是否存在已经能够直接复用的 MiniMax Design、Adobe 官方接口、JSX/CEP/UXP/Generator、ComfyUI 或其他 Host 路径，从而大幅缩短实现路线？\n3. DESIGN-LAB 当前前端、后端、State、Packaging、Browser E2E、软件 Adapter、Evidence/Authority/CI 分别还缺什么才能成为真正可运行的专业设计产品？\n4. 下一阶段应该做什么、按什么顺序做、哪些旧路线应该停止，才能用最短路径完成 E2 → E3 → E4 → E5？\n\n必须以“实时事实优先、产品闭环优先、减少重复架构、减少无必要软件自动化”为原则。\n\n======================================================================\n一、研究原则\n======================================================================\n\n必须遵守以下原则：\n\nA. 禁止依赖聊天历史中的旧 SHA、旧 CI、旧 branch 状态作为当前事实。\n\nB. 必须实时读取 GitHub origin/main。\n\n优先实际执行：\n\ngit fetch origin\ngit rev-parse origin/main\n\n如果研究工具无法真正执行 git fetch，则必须通过 GitHub 官方 API、GitHub Connector 或 Git refs 实时读取：\n\nrefs/heads/main\n\n并明确写：\n\n“工具环境不支持本地 git fetch，本报告使用 GitHub 实时 refs/heads/main 等价获取远端 main SHA。”\n\n绝对不得假称执行了 git fetch。\n\nC. 仓库内部原始文件优先级高于二手报告。\n\n事实优先级：\n\n1. 当前 GitHub main\n2. 当前 GitHub Actions logs\n3. 当前仓库代码 / SQL / workflow / manifests\n4. 官方 Adobe / Playwright / GitHub / Python / MiniMax / ComfyUI 文档\n5. 官方开源仓库源码\n6. 此前调研报告\n7. 社区资料\n8. 推测\n\nD. 此前三轮研究只能作为“需要重新验证的假设”。\n\n尤其包括：\n\n- MiniMax Design 可操作 Photoshop\n- MiniMax Design 可连接 ComfyUI\n- MiniMax H3 可通过 ComfyUI 使用\n- DESIGN-LAB 已存在 Adobe Adapter\n- Photoshop/Illustrator 已存在 E3\n- Browser E2E 已完成\n- Design System 已可随 wheel 安装\n\n全部重新核验。\n\nE. 不允许把：\n\n“代码存在”\n\n等价为：\n\n“能力可运行”。\n\n必须区分：\n\nDECLARED\nIMPLEMENTED\nSTRUCTURAL_TESTED\nCONTROLLED_RUNTIME\nREAL_HOST_WORKFLOW\nHUMAN_ACCEPTED\nRELEASED\n\nF. 不允许因为历史 evidence 存在，就自动认定当前 main 具备相同能力。\n\n必须检查：\n\n- evidence SHA\n- current main ancestry\n- host version\n- adapter version\n- requiresRequalification\n- artifact provenance\n- current regression coverage\n\nG. 若公开资料无法证明某能力：\n\n必须写：\n\n“未指定 / 无公开稳定契约 / 需 Host 授权验证”\n\n不得猜测。\n\n======================================================================\n二、执行计划与时间估算\n======================================================================\n\n最终报告开头首先给出 3–5 行执行计划。\n\n参考：\n\n阶段一：实时仓库与 CI 全量审计，约 1 人日。\n阶段二：MiniMax / Adobe / ComfyUI / 软件 Adapter 深度技术核验，约 2–3 人日。\n阶段三：前后端、Packaging、State、Browser E2E 成熟方案设计，约 1–2 人日。\n阶段四：Authority / Evidence / Branch / Reports 收敛与 Final TaskPack，约 1 人日。\n\n这是工程工作量估算，不是要求研究系统等待对应时间。\n\n研究必须在当前执行中直接完成，不得说“稍后继续”“等待结果”。\n\n======================================================================\n三、必须实时获取的执行基线\n======================================================================\n\n必须首先获取并记录：\n\n- 仓库：DTALEX66/DESIGN-LAB\n- 默认分支\n- main 最新 SHA\n- main 最新 commit 时间\n- main 最新 commit message\n- repository tree 是否完整\n- 文件总数\n- directory 总数\n- open Pull Requests\n- open Issues\n- GitHub Releases\n- Tags\n- remote branches\n- GitHub Actions 最近 main runs\n- 最新 Canonical CI run\n- 最新成功 run ID\n- 最新失败 run ID（如果有）\n- 当前 Workbench CI\n- Browser E2E CI\n- Packaging / wheel CI\n- Release Gate\n- branch protection（如果权限允许）\n\n必须给出：\n\n“执行基线”表格。\n\n至少包含：\n\n| 项目 | 当前实时值 | 来源 | 验证状态 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| main SHA | ... | GitHub | VERIFIED |\n| main timestamp | ... | GitHub | VERIFIED |\n| CI Run ID | ... | Actions | VERIFIED |\n| Open PR | ... | GitHub | VERIFIED |\n| Open Issue | ... | GitHub | VERIFIED |\n| Remote branches | ... | Git refs | VERIFIED |\n| Releases | ... | GitHub | VERIFIED |\n| Branch protection | ... | API | VERIFIED / PERMISSION_DENIED |\n\n如果 branch protection API 返回 403：\n\n必须写 403。\n\n不得引用旧 Authority 文本冒充当前 GitHub branch protection。\n\n======================================================================\n四、仓库全量审计范围\n======================================================================\n\n必须读取并交叉核验以下内容。\n\n------------------------------\nAuthority / Governance\n------------------------------\n\n至少搜索：\n\nAUTHORITY.md\nAGENTS.md\nauthority-index.json\nTaskPack\nRoadmap\nPRODUCT_DEFINITION\nARCHITECTURE\nLANGUAGE-POLICY\nEvidence policies\nRelease policies\nreports/current/**\ndocs/current/**\n.project/**\n.github/**\n\n判断：\n\nAuthority 与代码是否一致？\n\nTaskPack 是否还包含已经完成的任务？\n\nLANGUAGE-POLICY 是否仍描述旧 Node/TypeScript 状态？\n\nreports/current 是否真的 current？\n\nauthority-index 是否存在 stale drift？\n\n------------------------------\nWorkbench 前端\n------------------------------\n\n完整审计：\n\napps/workbench/**\npackage.json\npnpm-workspace.yaml\npnpm-lock.yaml\ntsconfig\nvite config\nbuild\nfrontend tests\n\n重点回答：\n\nWorkbench 当前是不是产品 UI？\n\n是否只是 debug/form shell？\n\n是否有：\n\nProject\nAsset\nReference\nBrief\nDirection\nChoice\nDesignSystem\nDesignIR\nHost Execution\nReadback\nRevision\nEvidence\n\nUI？\n\n检查：\n\nTypeScript strict\nVite\ncommitted build\nfrontend contract\nAPI client\nerror states\nloading states\nasset picker\nreference picker\nstate refresh\nbrowser testability\n\n------------------------------\nPython Backend\n------------------------------\n\n审计：\n\nHTTP service\nrouting\nrequest validation\nauthentication\nOrigin / Host / CSP\nstate layer\nSQLite\nasset APIs\nbrief APIs\ndirection APIs\ndesign-system APIs\nadapter APIs\nruntime APIs\n\n必须检查：\n\n- 项目隔离\n- asset ownership\n- reference validation\n- idempotency\n- transaction boundaries\n- concurrency\n- error contracts\n- fail-closed behavior\n- request schema\n- persisted types\n- replay safety\n\n------------------------------\nSQLite / State\n------------------------------\n\n审计：\n\nschema\nmigration\nbrief\ndirection\nbinding\nassets\nintent\nversion\nsuperseded_by\nchosen\nhistory\nevidence\n\n重点重现：\n\n多 chosen direction\nfalse chosen_direction\nunchosen bind\nconstraints 类型\nreference ownership\nversion/revision 语义\n\n如果这些已经修复：\n\n必须说明在哪个 commit 修复。\n\n------------------------------\nDesign Layer\n------------------------------\n\n重新确认真实纵切。\n\n可能是：\n\nProject\n→ Brief\n→ Direction\n→ DesignSystem\n\n也可能已经是：\n\nProject\n→ Reference\n→ Brief\n→ Direction\n→ Choice\n→ DesignSystem\n\n不得直接沿用旧报告。\n\n必须通过：\n\n代码\nHTTP tests\nBrowser tests\nDB readback\n\n判定。\n\n------------------------------\nDesign Systems\n------------------------------\n\n审计：\n\ndesign-lab/design-systems/**\nmanifests\nloader\ncatalog\npackage-resource access\n\n重点检查：\n\n源码 checkout 可用 ≠ wheel installed 可用。\n\n------------------------------\nPackaging\n------------------------------\n\n完整读取：\n\npyproject.toml\nwheel configuration\nforce-include\npackage-data\nbuild scripts\nwheel smoke\nisolated install tests\n\n必须真正判断：\n\nDesign System manifests 是否进入 wheel？\n\n安装后离开 repo CWD 是否仍可：\n\nimport design_lab\nload catalog\nrun Design Layer\n\n------------------------------\nBrowser E2E\n------------------------------\n\n审计：\n\nPlaywright\nChromium\nlocal cache\nnpm cache\nCI\nskip condition\nbrowser driver\ntest fixtures\n\n必须区分：\n\nLOCAL E2\n\n与：\n\nEXACT-SHA CI E2\n\n不得把 skip 当 PASS。\n\n------------------------------\nAdobe / Software Adapter\n------------------------------\n\n必须全量搜索：\n\nphotoshop\nillustrator\nbridge\nindesign\nafter effects\npremiere\nacrobat\ngenerator\nCEP\nUXP\nExtendScript\nJSX\nAdobe IO\nCreative Cloud\nPhotoshop API\nPhotoshop SDK\nBridgeTalk\nCOM\nAppleScript\nplugin\nadapter\nhost\nreadback\nPSD\nAI\n\n列出所有现有 Adapter。\n\n------------------------------\nMiniMax / ComfyUI / H3\n------------------------------\n\n搜索：\n\nminimax\nMiniMax Design\nH3\nComfyUI\nworkflow\nprompt\n8188\nsystem_stats\nobject_info\nhistory\nwebsocket\nrender job\nasset bridge\n\n同时检查此前 MiniMax / ComfyUI / H3 调研材料。\n\n但必须重新核验官方最新资料。\n\n------------------------------\nEvidence / CI\n------------------------------\n\n检查：\n\nEvidence Cards\nE0–E5\nRelease Gate\nHuman Jury\nVisual scoring\nHost evidence\nrequiresRequalification\nartifact provenance\ncurrent SHA binding\n\n------------------------------\nBranches\n------------------------------\n\n所有 remote branches 分类：\n\nMERGED\nAHEAD\nDIVERGED\nSTALE\nHISTORICAL\nACTIVE\n\n不能只看 ahead/behind。\n\n需要判断：\n\nunique commits 是否已经 semantic absorbed。\n\n------------------------------\nreports/current\n------------------------------\n\n检查：\n\nsubjectSha\ngeneratedAt\nfresh\ndirty\nsource tree\nevidence timestamp\n\n判断：\n\n是否为 live truth。\n\n======================================================================\n五、全量发现清单\n======================================================================\n\n必须提供一个大表：\n\n| 模块 | 文件/路径 | 当前实现 | 证据 | 当前状态 | 风险 | 优先级 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\n至少覆盖：\n\nAuthority\nWorkbench\nHTTP API\nSQLite\nDesign Layer\nReference\nDesign Systems\nPackaging\nBrowser E2E\nPhotoshop\nIllustrator\nBridge\nMiniMax Design\nComfyUI\nH3\nEvidence\nCI\nRelease\nBranches\nreports/current\n\n状态只能优先使用：\n\nVERIFIED\nPARTIAL\nSTRUCTURAL_ONLY\nRUNTIME_VERIFIED\nHOST_REQUIRED\nSTALE\nBROKEN\nNOT_IMPLEMENTED\nUNKNOWN\n\n======================================================================\n六、前十项关键缺陷\n======================================================================\n\n必须给出 TOP 10。\n\n分：\n\nP0\nP1\nP2\n\n表格必须包含：\n\n| 排名 | 缺陷 | P级 | 复现 | 根因 | 影响 | 修复建议 | 回归测试 | 风险缓解 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\n每项必须给：\n\n复现步骤\n根因\n业务影响\n技术影响\n修复方案\n测试\n风险\n优先级理由\n\n优先重新验证此前发现：\n\n1. multiple chosen Direction\n2. false chosen_direction\n3. unchosen bind\n4. constraints type mismatch\n5. fake/reference placeholder\n6. wheel catalog missing\n7. browser E2E skip\n8. stale Authority/TaskPack/LANGUAGE-POLICY\n9. revision/versioning 空壳\n10. stale E3 requalification\n\n如果当前 main 已修：\n\n不要继续列为 defect。\n\n改成：\n\nFIXED SINCE PRIOR AUDIT\n\n并给 commit。\n\n======================================================================\n七、MiniMax Design 与 Adobe 软件控制专项调查\n======================================================================\n\n这是报告最重要的研究章节之一。\n\n目标：\n\n回答：\n\n“MiniMax Design 为什么看起来可以直接操作 Photoshop，而 DESIGN-LAB 为什么这么复杂？”\n\n必须区分四件事：\n\n1. MiniMax Design UI 看起来能操作 Photoshop\n2. MiniMax Design 内部是否调用 Adobe 官方接口\n3. DESIGN-LAB 能否复用同一路径\n4. 是否必须让 MiniMax Design 做中转\n\n禁止因为 UI 演示就推断 API 存在。\n\n必须优先查询：\n\nMiniMax 官方网站\nMiniMax 官方 GitHub\nMiniMax Design 官方插件\nMiniMax Design release/docs\nAdobe 官方开发文档\nAdobe UXP\nPhotoshop UXP\nPhotoshop API\nPhotoshop Generator\nCEP\nExtendScript\nBridgeTalk\nAdobe IO\nAdobe Creative Cloud APIs\n\n必要时查看官方 GitHub 源码。\n\n------------------------------\n必须回答 Adobe 产品矩阵\n------------------------------\n\n至少：\n\nPhotoshop\nIllustrator\nBridge\nInDesign\nAfter Effects\nPremiere Pro\nAcrobat\nLightroom（若相关）\n\n表格：\n\n| Adobe 产品 | 当前仓库已有控制代码 | 官方自动化方式 | DESIGN-LAB 可直接用 | 需新增 Adapter | 需真实 Host | MiniMax 可否作为中转 | 当前证据 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\n重点：\n\nPhotoshop\nIllustrator\nBridge\nGenerator\n\n------------------------------\n协议分析\n------------------------------\n\n至少比较：\n\nJSX / ExtendScript\nCEP\nUXP\nPhotoshop Generator\nPhotoshop API / Adobe IO\nBridgeTalk\nDesktop Plugin\nNative SDK\nOS-level automation\nMiniMax Design mediation\n\n给出：\n\n| 技术 | Host | 能力 | 生命周期 | 双向 readback | 安全 | 维护风险 | 推荐用途 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\n------------------------------\n调用链\n------------------------------\n\n至少画出：\n\n方案 A：\n\nDESIGN-LAB\n→ Adapter\n→ Photoshop\n\n方案 B：\n\nDESIGN-LAB\n→ MiniMax Design\n→ Photoshop\n\n方案 C：\n\nDESIGN-LAB\n→ External Host Service\n→ Photoshop\n\n以及：\n\nDESIGN-LAB\n→ ComfyUI\n→ H3\n\n必须指出：\n\nMiniMax Design 并不应该自动成为所有 Adobe 软件的统一总线，除非存在公开稳定、可调用、可版本化的接口。\n\n------------------------------\n三方案比较\n------------------------------\n\n必须比较：\n\n直接集成\nMiniMax 中转\n外部 Host Service\n\n表格：\n\n| 方案 | 延迟 | 稳定性 | 可测试性 | Host 控制 | Readback | 授权 | 供应商锁定 | 推荐 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\n------------------------------\n安全 / License\n------------------------------\n\n研究：\n\n- Adobe SDK licensing\n- UXP plugin constraints\n- CEP status\n- JSX execution boundary\n- filesystem permission\n- Host process control\n- arbitrary script execution\n- user authorization\n- MiniMax license / public contract\n- ComfyUI custom-node supply-chain\n\n不得默认 UI automation 等价于官方受支持 API。\n\n======================================================================\n八、MiniMax Design / ComfyUI / H3 专项\n======================================================================\n\n结合此前研究，重新核实：\n\nMiniMax Design 是否有公开稳定的 arbitrary ComfyUI Base URL？\n\n是否能够直接配置：\n\nhttp://127.0.0.1:8188\n\n？\n\n是否只有官方 plugin integration，而不是通用 endpoint？\n\nMiniMax H3 是否已有官方 ComfyUI 路径？\n\nComfyUI 当前核心 server API 是否包括：\n\nPOST /prompt\nGET /history/{prompt_id}\nGET /view\nGET /system_stats\nGET /object_info\nPOST /upload/image\n/ws\n\n？\n\n重新验证官方源。\n\n若结论仍成立：\n\n推荐架构应优先：\n\nDESIGN-LAB\n→ ComfyUIAdapter\n→ Local ComfyUI\n→ H3\n\n而不是：\n\nDESIGN-LAB\n→ MiniMax Design\n→ undocumented interface\n→ ComfyUI\n\nMiniMax Design 应优先定位为：\n\nCreative Agent\nCanvas\nHuman Interaction\nAsset Bridge\n\n而不是强依赖 Control Plane。\n\n必须说明：\n\n哪些属于：\n\nCONFIRMED OFFICIAL\nCONFIRMED CODE\nINFERRED\nUNCONFIRMED\n\n======================================================================\n九、Packaging 成熟方案\n======================================================================\n\n如果当前 wheel 仍未完整包含 Design System manifests：\n\n提出可执行方案。\n\n优先考虑：\n\nimportlib.resources\n\n而不是：\n\nPROJECT_ROOT / git checkout path\n\n给出推荐结构，例如：\n\nsrc/design_lab/resources/design_systems/...\n\n或合理等价结构。\n\n必须给可复制命令：\n\npython -m build\npython -m zipfile -l dist/*.whl\npython -m venv ...\npip install ...\npython -I ...\n\n必须设计：\n\ninstalled-wheel smoke\n\n测试要求：\n\n临时目录\n不在 repo CWD\n从 site-packages import\n读取 Design Systems\n创建 Project\n创建 Brief\n创建 Direction\nchoose\nbind\nreadback\n\n------------------------------\nInventory checklist\n------------------------------\n\n必须确认 wheel：\n\n应该包含：\n\nPython package\nWorkbench build\nDB schema\nDesign-system manifests\n必要 adapter scripts\n\n不得包含：\n\n.project-local\n.git\ncredentials\ncache\nlogs\ntest artifacts\nnode_modules\nPlaywright browsers\n用户资产\n\n======================================================================\n十、Packaging CI YAML\n======================================================================\n\n给出一段真实可复制 GitHub Actions job 示例。\n\n例如目标：\n\nwheel-smoke\n\n需要：\n\ncheckout\nsetup-python\nuv/pip build\nbuild wheel\ninspect wheel\ninstall wheel in isolated venv\ncd 到 repo 外\nrun smoke\nupload logs\n\n不得使用伪 YAML。\n\n必须尽量符合当前仓库实际 package manager。\n\n若仓库使用 uv：\n\n按 uv。\n\n若不是：\n\n按实际工具。\n\n======================================================================\n十一、Browser E2E exact-SHA CI 方案\n======================================================================\n\n必须重新检查当前 Playwright 方式。\n\n最终设计：\n\nGitHub Actions：\n\ncheckout exact commit\nsetup Python\ninstall backend\nsetup Node\nenable pnpm\npnpm install --frozen-lockfile\ninstall Playwright browser\nstart DESIGN-LAB service\nhealth check\nrun Chromium\nexecute real Design Layer flow\npersisted readback\ncollect artifacts\n\n必须明确：\n\nCI 不允许：\n\ndependency missing → skip → green\n\n对于 Browser E2E：\n\n缺 Chromium 应该是 infra failure。\n\n------------------------------\n缓存策略\n------------------------------\n\n分析：\n\npnpm cache\nPlaywright browser cache\nPython/uv cache\n\n不得缓存：\n\nruntime DB\nuser assets\nauthorization token\ntest state\n\n------------------------------\nfailure handling\n------------------------------\n\n失败自动上传：\n\nPlaywright report\ntrace.zip\nscreenshots\nservice logs\nbrowser console\nDB snapshot（去敏）\n\n------------------------------\n必须给 YAML\n------------------------------\n\n给一个可以复制改造的 GitHub Actions job。\n\n------------------------------\n必须给 Mermaid\n------------------------------\n\n例如：\n\nflowchart LR\n    A[Checkout exact SHA]\n    B[Install Python]\n    C[Install pnpm]\n    D[Build Workbench]\n    E[Install Chromium]\n    F[Start API]\n    G[Run Browser E2E]\n    H[DB Readback]\n    I[Upload Artifacts]\n\n    A --> B --> C --> D --> E --> F --> G --> H\n    G -->|fail| I\n    H -->|fail| I\n\n根据真实仓库调整。\n\n======================================================================\n十二、Reference 接入成熟方案\n======================================================================\n\n重新确认 Reference 当前是否已接入。\n\n如果仍未完整实现：\n\n设计：\n\nProject\n→ Asset import\n→ Reference picker\n→ Brief\n→ Direction\n→ Choice\n→ Design System\n\n------------------------------\nFrontend\n------------------------------\n\n设计 Asset/Reference picker：\n\n- thumbnail/list\n- selected state\n- asset metadata\n- loading/error\n- empty state\n- project scoping\n- duplicate prevention\n\n不要建设第二 Canvas。\n\n------------------------------\nBackend contract\n------------------------------\n\n建议类似：\n\nPOST /api/projects/{project_id}/briefs\n\n{\n  \"title\": \"...\",\n  \"constraints\": \"...\",\n  \"reference_asset_ids\": [\n    \"ast_...\"\n  ],\n  \"operation_intent\": \"...\"\n}\n\n但必须以当前 API 风格为准。\n\nBackend 必须验证：\n\nasset exists\nasset project matches\nasset is active\nID shape\ncount limit\nduplicate IDs\npermitted asset kind\n\n------------------------------\n错误码\n------------------------------\n\n建议：\n\nREFERENCE_ASSET_NOT_FOUND\nREFERENCE_ASSET_PROJECT_MISMATCH\nREFERENCE_ASSET_INVALID\nREFERENCE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED\n\n但与现有错误风格对齐。\n\n------------------------------\n数据库\n------------------------------\n\n比较：\n\n方案 A：\nJSON reference_asset_ids\n\n方案 B：\nbrief_reference_asset relation\n\n成熟方案优先关系表。\n\n推荐分析：\n\nbrief_reference_assets(\n  brief_revision_id,\n  asset_id,\n  ordinal,\n  created_at\n)\n\n如果 revision model 要引入：\n\n直接挂 Brief Revision。\n\n------------------------------\n测试矩阵\n------------------------------\n\n至少：\n\nvalid asset\nmissing asset\ncross-project\nduplicate\ndeleted/inactive\nmax count\nempty refs\nmultiple refs\nHTTP roundtrip\nDB persistence\nBrowser E2E\n\n======================================================================\n十三、State / Revision / Versioning\n======================================================================\n\n必须重新判断当前：\n\nversion\nsuperseded_by\n\n是否真的工作。\n\n目标设计为：\n\nappend-only domain revision model。\n\n推荐实体：\n\nProject\nAsset\nBrief\nBriefRevision\nDirection\nDirectionRevision\nChoiceEvent\nDesignSystem\nDesignSystemBindingRevision\nOperationIntent\n\n旧记录不被业务 UPDATE 覆盖。\n\n------------------------------\n设计原则\n------------------------------\n\nBrief 的“修改”：\n\ncreate BriefRevision v2\n\n而不是 UPDATE v1。\n\nDirection 同理。\n\nBinding 同理。\n\nChoice 最好是 Event。\n\n------------------------------\nchosen\n------------------------------\n\n不要把：\n\nchosen BOOLEAN\n\n作为唯一业务真值，除非 transaction/invariant 足够严密。\n\n更成熟方式可以是：\n\nDirectionChoiceEvent\n\n或：\n\nbrief.active_direction_revision_id\n\n需要比较优缺点。\n\n------------------------------\n事务\n------------------------------\n\n切换选择必须：\n\nBEGIN IMMEDIATE / appropriate transaction\n\n验证 ownership\n\n写新 choice\n\n更新 active pointer / close old choice\n\nCOMMIT\n\n任何失败 rollback。\n\n------------------------------\n幂等\n------------------------------\n\noperation_intent 应保证：\n\nsame intent\nsame semantic operation\nsame result\n\n尤其：\n\ncreate\nchoose\nbind\nrevision\n\n------------------------------\n必须给 DDL\n------------------------------\n\n给出可执行 SQLite DDL 示例。\n\n例如：\n\nCREATE TABLE brief_revisions (...);\n\nCREATE TABLE direction_revisions (...);\n\nCREATE TABLE direction_choice_events (...);\n\nCREATE TABLE design_system_binding_revisions (...);\n\n但必须兼容当前 schema 风格。\n\n------------------------------\n必须给 migration steps\n------------------------------\n\n从现有 schema：\n\n1. create new tables\n2. backfill\n3. validate\n4. dual-read/temporary compatibility（如果需要）\n5. switch reader\n6. switch writer\n7. remove obsolete semantics later\n\n不得做一次性 destructive migration。\n\n------------------------------\n必须给 ER Mermaid\n------------------------------\n\n例如：\n\nerDiagram\n\nPROJECT ||--o{ ASSET : owns\nPROJECT ||--o{ BRIEF : owns\nBRIEF ||--o{ BRIEF_REVISION : versions\nBRIEF_REVISION ||--o{ BRIEF_REFERENCE : cites\nASSET ||--o{ BRIEF_REFERENCE : used_by\nBRIEF_REVISION ||--o{ DIRECTION : proposes\nDIRECTION ||--o{ DIRECTION_REVISION : versions\nBRIEF_REVISION ||--o{ DIRECTION_CHOICE_EVENT : chooses\nDESIGN_SYSTEM ||--o{ DESIGN_SYSTEM_BINDING_REVISION : bound\nDIRECTION_REVISION ||--o{ DESIGN_SYSTEM_BINDING_REVISION : receives\n\n根据真实架构修正。\n\n======================================================================\n十四、前端成熟方案\n======================================================================\n\n除修 bug 之外，需要评价 Workbench 是否已经具备长期产品骨架。\n\n分析：\n\n页面 / panel architecture\nstate synchronization\nAPI client\nerror handling\nloading states\nempty states\ndomain forms\nasset/reference panel\ndirection comparison\nhuman choice\ndesign system binding\nversion history\nhost execution status\nevidence panel\n\n不要建议无意义 React 重写。\n\n如果当前 Vanilla TS + Vite 足够：\n\n继续用。\n\n只有真实工程理由才建议框架迁移。\n\n明确区分：\n\n现在必须做\n\n与：\n\n以后可做。\n\n======================================================================\n十五、后端成熟方案\n======================================================================\n\n分析：\n\nHTTP service 是否应继续保留轻量实现。\n\n不要因为“成熟”就自动换 FastAPI/Django。\n\n只有出现：\n\nrouting complexity\nschema validation burden\nasync providers\nwebsocket\nplugin hosting\n\n等真实需求时才提出迁移。\n\n重点是：\n\ndomain service\nstate service\nadapter service\njob service\nasset service\n\n的边界。\n\n建议明确层次：\n\nHTTP\n↓\nApplication Services\n↓\nDomain\n↓\nState / Adapter\n\n不要让 HTTP Handler 直接写大量 SQL。\n\n======================================================================\n十六、软件控制层成熟架构\n======================================================================\n\n在报告中提出统一 Software Adapter Contract。\n\n例如：\n\nHostCapability\nHostCommand\nHostResult\nArtifact\nReadback\nHostSession\n\nAdapter：\n\nPhotoshopAdapter\nIllustratorAdapter\nBridgeAdapter\nComfyUIAdapter\nMiniMaxAssetBridge\n\n不要为了“统一”强迫完全不同的软件都用相同低级 API。\n\n统一应该发生在 domain contract：\n\nexecute\nreadback\nartifact\ncapability\nhealth\nversion\n\n而不是：\n\nclick(x,y)\n\n------------------------------\n软件侧分类\n------------------------------\n\n给出：\n\nDIRECT_API\nPLUGIN_HOSTED\nSCRIPT_HOSTED\nLOCAL_SERVICE\nASSET_BRIDGE\nUI_AUTOMATION_LAST_RESORT\n\n每个目标软件分类。\n\n======================================================================\n十七、Authority / Policy / Reports 收敛\n======================================================================\n\n必须逐一提出具体 edits。\n\n------------------------------\nAUTHORITY.md\n------------------------------\n\n只更新：\n\ncurrent state\nremaining blockers\nevidence semantics\n\n不要重写整个 Authority。\n\n------------------------------\nauthority-index.json\n------------------------------\n\n清理 stale drift。\n\n生成建议：\n\n从 canonical sources 自动检查状态。\n\n------------------------------\nLANGUAGE-POLICY\n------------------------------\n\n同步：\n\nPython\nTypeScript\nNode\npnpm\nVite\nlockfiles\n\n不得描述已不存在的状态。\n\n------------------------------\nTaskPack\n------------------------------\n\n完成项：\n\nCLOSED_WITH_REGRESSION_GUARD\n\n不要继续作为 open task。\n\n------------------------------\nreports/current\n------------------------------\n\n推荐把状态明确区分：\n\nLIVE_STATE\nLAST_GENERATED_PROJECTION\nHISTORICAL\n\n如果目录不能改：\n\n文件内部必须写：\n\nsubjectSha\ncurrentMainSha\nfresh\ngeneratedAt\nevidenceAsOf\n\n当：\n\nsubjectSha != main\n\n必须显式：\n\nSTALE\n\n------------------------------\n生成策略\n------------------------------\n\n提出：\n\nCI-generated projection\n\n但：\n\n生成报告 ≠ 生成新 Evidence。\n\n======================================================================\n十八、Evidence / E0–E5 收敛\n======================================================================\n\n使用严格定义：\n\nE0 = DECLARED\nE1 = STRUCTURAL\nE2 = CONTROLLED_RUNTIME\nE3 = REAL_WORKFLOW\nE4 = INDEPENDENT_ACCEPTANCE\nE5 = RELEASED / REPEATABLE\n\n重新对每个 capability 评级。\n\n重点：\n\nDesign Layer\nWorkbench\nBrowser E2E\nPhotoshop\nIllustrator\nComfyUI\nMiniMax H3\nProduction handoff\nVisual Quality\nHuman Jury\nRelease\n\n表格：\n\n| Capability | Required | Structural | Runtime | Real Host | Human | Release | Effective Level |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\n如果：\n\nrequiresRequalification = true\n\n旧 E3 不得直接算 current effective E3。\n\n必须设计：\n\neffectiveEvidence\n\n算法。\n\n======================================================================\n十九、远端 Branch 审计\n======================================================================\n\n所有 branch 给分类。\n\n至少：\n\nbranch\nhead SHA\nahead\nbehind\nmerge-base\nunique commits\nsemantic status\nrecommended action\n\n分类：\n\nMERGED_CLEANUP_CANDIDATE\nDOC_RESIDUAL\nSEMANTICALLY_ABSORBED\nPARTIAL_RESIDUAL\nHISTORICAL\nACTIVE\nDO_NOT_MERGE_WHOLE\n\n不要建议自动删除 branch。\n\n只给 cleanup candidate。\n\n尤其审计此前提到的：\n\ndocs/e-slice-session-summary-20260919\nR4\nmigration\nE-slice branches\n\n但以当前 live refs 为准。\n\n======================================================================\n二十、reports/current 审计\n======================================================================\n\n逐个重要 report 检查：\n\nsubject SHA\ngeneration time\ndirty status\nfresh\nevidence source\ncurrent main match\n\n表：\n\n| Report | subject SHA | main SHA | Fresh | Live Truth? | 建议 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\n======================================================================\n二十一、成熟目标架构\n======================================================================\n\n在最终报告中给一张总架构 Mermaid。\n\n推荐研究方向：\n\nflowchart TB\n\n    UI[Workbench]\n    API[DESIGN-LAB HTTP API]\n    APP[Application Services]\n    STATE[SQLite / Domain State]\n    ASSET[Asset Registry]\n    DS[Design System Registry]\n    HOST[Host Adapter Layer]\n    PS[Photoshop]\n    AI[Illustrator]\n    BR[Bridge]\n    CUI[ComfyUI]\n    H3[MiniMax H3]\n    MD[MiniMax Design]\n    EV[Evidence]\n\n    UI --> API\n    API --> APP\n    APP --> STATE\n    APP --> ASSET\n    APP --> DS\n    APP --> HOST\n\n    HOST --> PS\n    HOST --> AI\n    HOST --> BR\n    HOST --> CUI\n\n    CUI --> H3\n\n    MD <--> ASSET\n\n    APP --> EV\n\n必须根据实际研究结论调整。\n\nMiniMax Design 是否进入控制链：\n\n只能根据公开稳定接口判断。\n\n如果没有稳定 API：\n\n应该是 Asset/Creative Bridge，而非 mandatory control bus。\n\n======================================================================\n二十二、最终成熟路线\n======================================================================\n\n最终必须回答：\n\nDESIGN-LAB 不应该继续同时扩展所有能力。\n\n需要给出最短产品成熟路线。\n\n优先考虑：\n\n阶段 1：\nDesign Layer E2 收口\n\n阶段 2：\nAsset / Reference / Revision\n\n阶段 3：\nPackaging + Browser exact-SHA\n\n阶段 4：\nComfyUI/H3 Local Provider\n\n阶段 5：\nPhotoshop/Illustrator Host Adapter E3\n\n阶段 6：\nHuman / Preflight / Delivery E4\n\n阶段 7：\nRelease E5\n\n但必须根据当前 main 调整。\n\n======================================================================\n二十三、Final TaskPack\n======================================================================\n\n最终报告最重要的交付物。\n\n生成：\n\nBatch A–F\n\n每个 Batch 包含：\n\nTask ID\n任务\n前置依赖\nOwner Role\n涉及模块\n实现内容\n验收标准\n测试\nEvidence\n估算人日\n回滚策略\n\n角色必须使用：\n\nbackend\nfrontend\nci\npackaging\nqa\ndocs\nhost-integration\nsecurity\n\n------------------------------\n建议 Batch\n------------------------------\n\nBatch A — Product Correctness\n\n重点：\n\nDirection invariant\nchosen correctness\nbind validation\nconstraints\nReference\n\n如果已修：\n\n替换为当前真实 P0。\n\n------------------------------\nBatch B — State & Asset\n\nReference\nAsset ownership\nRevision model\nidempotency\n\n------------------------------\nBatch C — Packaging & Browser E2\n\nwheel\nresources\nisolated smoke\nPlaywright\nChromium exact-SHA\n\n------------------------------\nBatch D — Local Creative Providers\n\nComfyUI Adapter\nWorkflow Registry\nH3\nJob state\nasset output\nprivacy routing\n\n前提：\n\n官方事实支持。\n\n------------------------------\nBatch E — Adobe Host E3\n\nPhotoshop\nIllustrator\nBridge\n\n只选最有价值、官方接口最成熟的路径。\n\n不要一次做 Adobe 全家桶。\n\n------------------------------\nBatch F — Evidence / Governance / Release\n\nAuthority\nReports\nEvidence\nHuman Jury\nProduction preflight\nRelease\n\n------------------------------\n表格格式\n------------------------------\n\n| ID | Batch | Task | Owner | Depends On | Acceptance | Evidence | 人日 | Rollback |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---:|---|\n\n必须标明：\n\nM1\nM2\nM3\nM4\nM5\n\n里程碑。\n\n例如：\n\nM1 = Product Vertical Slice E2\nM2 = Installed + Browser exact-SHA E2\nM3 = Local Creative Provider E2/E3\nM4 = Adobe Host E3\nM5 = Human Accepted / Release Candidate\n\n------------------------------\n依赖关系\n------------------------------\n\n必须画 Mermaid：\n\ngraph TD\n\nA01 --> A02\nA02 --> B01\nB01 --> C01\nC01 --> C02\nC02 --> D01\nD01 --> E01\nE01 --> F01\n\n根据研究结果生成真实依赖图。\n\n======================================================================\n二十四、粗略人日估算\n======================================================================\n\n工期必须给：\n\n最小\n正常\n风险上限\n\n例如：\n\n| Batch | Min | Likely | High |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n\n不要给虚假的小时级精确估算。\n\n另外指出：\n\n哪些任务需要：\n\n真实 Adobe Host\nMiniMax Desktop\nWindows GPU\n本地 ComfyUI/H3\n用户授权\n\n这些不得计入纯 CI 可完成工作。\n\n======================================================================\n二十五、必须给出的可复制技术内容\n======================================================================\n\n报告至少必须提供：\n\n1. Git 基线命令\n2. Python wheel build 命令\n3. wheel inventory 命令\n4. isolated install smoke 命令\n5. Playwright install/run 命令\n6. GitHub Actions Browser E2E YAML\n7. GitHub Actions Wheel Smoke YAML\n8. SQLite revision DDL\n9. migration steps\n10. Reference API 示例\n11. ComfyUI health / workflow API 示例\n12. Adobe Host adapter 调用链示意\n\n所有命令必须：\n\n可复制\n\n且不得伪造仓库不存在的命令。\n\n如果当前仓库命令不同：\n\n使用真实命令。\n\n======================================================================\n二十六、图表要求\n======================================================================\n\n最终报告必须至少包含：\n\n图 1：\nDESIGN-LAB 成熟目标总架构图\n\nMermaid。\n\n图 2：\nBrowser E2E exact-SHA CI 流程图\n\nMermaid。\n\n图 3：\nState / Revision ER 图\n\nMermaid。\n\n图 4：\nMiniMax / Adobe / ComfyUI 控制路线图\n\nMermaid。\n\n此外至少包含一张“示意图”。\n\nMermaid 架构图可作为示意图。\n\n如研究系统具备图片搜索能力，可增加一张 Adobe / MiniMax / ComfyUI 官方架构或产品示意，但不得为了满足形式使用无关图片。\n\n======================================================================\n二十七、引用要求\n======================================================================\n\n这是 Deep Research。\n\n所有关键事实必须引用。\n\n优先引用：\n\nDTALEX66/DESIGN-LAB 当前仓库\nGitHub Actions\nAdobe 官方 docs\nAdobe Developer\nPlaywright 官方 docs\nPython packaging 官方 docs\nGitHub Actions 官方 docs\nMiniMax 官方 docs\nMiniMax-AI GitHub\nComfyUI 官方 GitHub / docs\n\n技术结论优先使用 primary sources。\n\n不要主要依赖：\n\n博客\n知乎\n论坛\nSEO 教程\n未经验证的视频\n\n社区资料只用于：\n\n补充实践经验\n\n不能替代官方能力声明。\n\n每个重大判断至少给来源。\n\n尤其：\n\nMiniMax Photoshop 控制\nAdobe API 能力\nCEP / UXP 状态\nComfyUI API\nPlaywright install behavior\n\n必须有官方引用。\n\n======================================================================\n二十八、最终报告结构\n======================================================================\n\n最终报告严格按以下结构。\n\n# DESIGN-LAB 全量审计与后续成熟方案\n\n## Executive Summary\n\n中文。\n\n首先 3–5 行：\n\n执行计划\n工程时间估算\n\n然后给 8–12 条最重要结论。\n\n必须直接回答：\n\nDESIGN-LAB 为什么看起来进度慢？\n\nMiniMax Design 为什么看起来能快速操作 PS？\n\n是不是 Adobe 全家桶都可以操作？\n\nDESIGN-LAB 是否应该通过 MiniMax Design 控制 Adobe？\n\n当前最大阻塞到底是软件控制，还是产品状态/证据/安装/CI？\n\n## 执行基线\n\nmain SHA\nCI Run\nPR\nIssues\nBranches\nReleases\n\n表格。\n\n## 当前产品成熟度\n\n前端\n后端\nState\nDesign Layer\nPackaging\nE2E\nAdapters\nEvidence\n\n表格。\n\n## 全量发现\n\n大表。\n\n## 关键缺陷与影响\n\nTop 10 P0/P1/P2。\n\n表格。\n\n## 前端与后端成熟度分析\n\nWorkbench\nAPI\nState\nAsset\nContracts\n\n## MiniMax Design、ComfyUI 与 H3\n\n官方事实\n当前仓库实现\n推荐边界\n\n## Adobe 软件控制可行性\n\nPhotoshop\nIllustrator\nBridge\nGenerator\n其余 Adobe\n\n大表。\n\n## 软件控制架构方案比较\n\nDirect\nMiniMax Relay\nExternal Host\n\n表格 + Mermaid。\n\n## Packaging 与安装态方案\n\n资源\nwheel\nsmoke\ninventory\n\n命令 + YAML。\n\n## Browser E2E exact-SHA CI\n\n设计\n缓存\nfailure\nartifacts\n\nYAML + Mermaid。\n\n## Reference 接入方案\n\nUI\nAPI\nDB\ntests\n\n## State / Revision Model\n\nDDL\ntransaction\nmigration\nER Mermaid\n\n## Authority / Policy / Reports 收敛\n\n具体 edits。\n\n## Evidence 与 Release\n\nE0–E5。\n\n## Remote Branch 审计\n\n表格。\n\n## 目标成熟架构\n\n总 Mermaid。\n\n## Final Maturity Convergence TaskPack\n\nBatch A–F。\n\n表格。\n\n## 里程碑与工期\n\nM1–M5。\n\n## 最终判断\n\n必须给一个诚实状态。\n\n使用以下之一：\n\nSTRUCTURAL_ONLY\n\nCONTROLLED_RUNTIME_READY\n\nPRODUCT_VERTICAL_SLICE_E2\n\nLOCAL_CREATIVE_PROVIDER_READY\n\nREAL_HOST_WORKFLOW_E3\n\nHUMAN_ACCEPTED_E4\n\nRELEASED_E5\n\n不得写：\n\n“基本完成”\n\n“差不多生产可用”\n\n“全部解决”\n\n等模糊措辞。\n\n======================================================================\n二十九、特别需要验证的历史假设\n======================================================================\n\n本研究必须特别验证此前审计提出过的以下问题，而不是默认它们仍存在。\n\nH1：\nDirection 可以同时多个 chosen。\n\nH2：\n没有 chosen 时 chosen_direction 回退最后 Direction。\n\nH3：\nBackend 可以给 unchosen direction bind Design System。\n\nH4：\nBrief constraints string/object 类型不一致。\n\nH5：\nReference 只是 reference_asset_ids: [] 或未验证字符串。\n\nH6：\nDesign Systems 没有进入 wheel。\n\nH7：\nGitHub Browser E2E 实际 skip。\n\nH8：\nAuthority / TaskPack / Language Policy 已落后。\n\nH9：\nversion / superseded_by 只是 schema 字段。\n\nH10：\nrequiresRequalification 的旧 E3 仍可能满足 Release floor。\n\n逐项给：\n\nSTILL_PRESENT\nFIXED\nPARTIALLY_FIXED\nNOT_REPRODUCIBLE\n\n并给证据。\n\n======================================================================\n三十、MiniMax / Adobe 研究特别注意事项\n======================================================================\n\n不要因为：\n\n“MiniMax Design 能让 Agent 操作 Photoshop”\n\n就自动得出：\n\n“MiniMax Design 暴露了稳定 Photoshop API”。\n\n必须调查真实机制可能属于：\n\n官方插件\n桌面 Agent\nUI automation\naccessibility\nAdobe scripting\nUXP\nCEP\nJSX\nnative bridge\nprivate IPC\nremote model control\n\n如果官方不披露：\n\n必须写：\n\n机制未公开。\n\n同理：\n\n不要因为 MiniMax Design 可以操作 Photoshop\n\n就推断：\n\nIllustrator\nPremiere\nAfter Effects\nInDesign\nBridge\nAcrobat\n\n全部自动具备同样能力。\n\n逐个 Host 判断。\n\n======================================================================\n三十一、最终路线设计原则\n======================================================================\n\n最终成熟方案必须优先：\n\n减少控制层\n\n减少 undocumented coupling\n\n减少 UI automation\n\n减少重复 state\n\n减少重复 backend\n\n减少重复 TaskPack\n\n减少旧 branch merge\n\n提高 exact-SHA evidence\n\n提高 install-state truth\n\n提高 real-host readback\n\n优先路径应该是：\n\n稳定官方 API\n>\n稳定脚本 Host\n>\n官方 plugin\n>\nlocal service API\n>\nAsset Bridge\n>\nUI automation\n\nMiniMax Design 只有在它提供稳定公开协议时，才进入核心执行链。\n\n否则：\n\nMiniMax Design = Creative UX + Agent + Asset Bridge\n\n而：\n\nDESIGN-LAB = Control Plane / State / Evidence / Adapter Orchestration\n\n======================================================================\n三十二、交付质量标准\n======================================================================\n\n最终报告必须满足：\n\n- 中文\n- 分析性\n- 可执行\n- 有表格\n- 有 Mermaid\n- 有实际命令\n- 有 CI YAML\n- 有 SQL\n- 有证据引用\n- 有真实 SHA\n- 有真实 Run ID\n- 有 branch snapshot\n- 有 Adobe 官方证据\n- 有 MiniMax 官方证据\n- 有 Playwright 官方证据\n- 有风险矩阵\n- 有 TaskPack\n- 有依赖顺序\n- 有人日估算\n- 有 rollback\n- 不伪造 Host evidence\n- 不把历史报告当当前事实\n- 不把 local skip 当 CI PASS\n\n研究结束时，读者应该能够：\n\n直接把 Final TaskPack 交给开发 Agent。\n\n不需要再做一次架构讨论。\n\n======================================================================\n三十三、最终必须回答的十个问题\n======================================================================\n\n报告结尾必须明确回答：\n\n1. DESIGN-LAB 当前真实成熟度是多少？\n2. 当前最大的 P0 是什么？\n3. Workbench 前端是否需要重写？\n4. Python Backend 是否需要换框架？\n5. MiniMax Design 是否应该成为 Photoshop 的主要控制层？\n6. Photoshop 当前最成熟的控制路线是什么？\n7. Illustrator 当前最成熟的控制路线是什么？\n8. ComfyUI/H3 应该如何进入 DESIGN-LAB？\n9. Adobe 全家桶是否能够“统一一次接入全部控制”？\n10. 完成哪几个里程碑后，DESIGN-LAB 才能诚实达到 E3、E4、E5？\n\nEND OF RESEARCH TASK\n```\n\n## 使用边界\n\n这份任务提示词把三类此前结果进行了统一：一类是 `DESIGN-LAB` 已发现的产品纵切、State、Packaging、Browser E2E 与治理漂移问题；一类是 MiniMax Design 与 Adobe 软件控制路线；另一类是已上传报告中形成的 **“DESIGN-LAB 直接把 ComfyUI/H3 作为 Local Inference Provider，而 MiniMax Design 优先作为创意交互与资产桥”** 的架构假设。后者在已有材料中已有较完整论证，但新一轮 Deep Research 仍应按提示词要求从 MiniMax、ComfyUI 和仓库当前代码重新验证，而不是直接继承为事实。fileciteturn0file0\n\n最重要的改动，是把这次研究从“再找更多可控制的软件”改成了**判断每一种软件到底应该通过哪一级稳定接口接入**。最终 TaskPack 因此不会简单得到“Adobe 全家桶都做 Adapter”的结论，而会把 Photoshop、Illustrator、Bridge、ComfyUI/H3、MiniMax Design 分别归入 `DIRECT_API / SCRIPT_HOSTED / PLUGIN_HOSTED / LOCAL_SERVICE / ASSET_BRIDGE / UI_AUTOMATION_LAST_RESORT`，从而直接决定下一阶段应该写什么代码、什么代码不应该再写。"]},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":true,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"citations":[{"start_ix":231,"end_ix":252,"citation_format_type":"berry_file_search","metadata":{"type":"file","name":"粘贴的 markdown (1)。md","id":"file_00000000ba1c81fd9246d39627bbb920","source":"my_files","text":null,"extra":{"retrieval_turn":0,"retrieval_file_index":0,"cited_message_idx":27,"cited_message_id":"56cfab19-8768-430f-932f-777fbcb8262f","search_result_idx":null,"line_range":null,"cloud_doc_url":null,"authors_display":null,"doi":null,"publication_year":null,"journal_name":null,"source_label":null,"journal_homepage_url":null,"source_url":null,"source_icon_url":null,"set_id":null,"spl_version":null,"run_id":null,"title":null,"effective_time":null}}},{"start_ix":33309,"end_ix":33330,"citation_format_type":"berry_file_search","metadata":{"type":"file","name":"粘贴的 markdown (1)。md","id":"file_00000000ba1c81fd9246d39627bbb920","source":"my_files","text":null,"extra":{"retrieval_turn":0,"retrieval_file_index":0,"cited_message_idx":27,"cited_message_id":"56cfab19-8768-430f-932f-777fbcb8262f","search_result_idx":null,"line_range":null,"cloud_doc_url":null,"authors_display":null,"doi":null,"publication_year":null,"journal_name":null,"source_label":null,"journal_homepage_url":null,"source_url":null,"source_icon_url":null,"set_id":null,"spl_version":null,"run_id":null,"title":null,"effective_time":null}}}],"content_references":[{"matched_text":"fileciteturn0file0","start_idx":231,"end_idx":252,"alt":null,"type":"file","name":"粘贴的 markdown (1)。md","id":"file_00000000ba1c81fd9246d39627bbb920","source":"my_files","snippet":null,"cloud_doc_url":null,"library_file_id":null,"library_artifact_type":null,"medical_file_reference":{"authors_display":null,"doi":null,"publication_year":null,"journal_name":null,"source_label":null,"journal_homepage_url":null,"source_url":null,"source_icon_url":null},"drug_file_reference":null,"page_range_start":null,"page_range_end":null,"input_pointer":{"message_index":0,"message_id":"56cfab19-8768-430f-932f-777fbcb8262f","file_index":0,"line_range_start":null,"line_range_end":null},"fff_metadata":null,"connector_id":null},{"matched_text":"fileciteturn0file0","start_idx":33309,"end_idx":33330,"alt":null,"type":"file","name":"粘贴的 markdown (1)。md","id":"file_00000000ba1c81fd9246d39627bbb920","source":"my_files","snippet":null,"cloud_doc_url":null,"library_file_id":null,"library_artifact_type":null,"medical_file_reference":{"authors_display":null,"doi":null,"publication_year":null,"journal_name":null,"source_label":null,"journal_homepage_url":null,"source_url":null,"source_icon_url":null},"drug_file_reference":null,"page_range_start":null,"page_range_end":null,"input_pointer":{"message_index":0,"message_id":"56cfab19-8768-430f-932f-777fbcb8262f","file_index":0,"line_range_start":null,"line_range_end":null},"fff_metadata":null,"connector_id":null}],"story_events":[],"resolved_model_slug":"gpt-5-thinking","gizmo_id":"g-p-6aa0fe853a748191ad8fe14b747ef04c","cot_version":"v5","venus_message":true},"recipient":"all","channel":"final"}},"activity_messages":[{"id":"a00b813b-01d9-4414-8bc7-eee045082201","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":1789821622.206714,"update_time":1789821627.811353,"content":{"content_type":"reasoning_recap","content":"已停止思考"},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":true,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_status":"reasoning_cancelled"},"recipient":"all","channel":null},{"id":"8d268303-2521-485e-aef4-21087f10ee16","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":1789996788.769117,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"thoughts","thoughts":[{"summary":"生成研究任务提示词","content":"我正在为“深度研究系统”整理一份可直接执行的研究任务提示词。由于用户需要的是提示词，而不是立即开展研究，我会保留其既有目标、范围、方法和交付要求，并明确要求系统核验此前结论、补充最新资料、区分事实与推测，最终形成结构化、可审计的研究报告。","chunks":[],"finished":true},{"summary":"Generated a research task prompt","content":"","chunks":[],"finished":true}],"source_analysis_msg_id":"ab83f395-9133-4df7-8b8c-e52095a7a9e9"},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":false,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_status":"is_reasoning"},"recipient":"all","channel":null},{"id":"9afc6beb-f635-4aad-81b3-e1252f10b525","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":1789996960.851446,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"reasoning_recap","content":"Worked for 3m 8s"},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":false,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_status":"reasoning_ended"},"recipient":"all","channel":null},{"id":"49f9b8fb-7e21-5957-b895-fc7160a612e7","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":null,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"reasoning_recap","content":""},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":false,"weight":0.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_title":"Generated report on DESIGN-LAB 全量审计与后续成熟方案 Deep Research 执行提示词"},"recipient":"all","channel":null}],"source_searches":[]}